update_toolbar_size() reads the pad fields of the TB_GETMETRICS reply
without initialising them, so where the control leaves them unset (Wine has
no TB_GETMETRICS) the toolbar is sized from stack garbage; under clang that
left room for two text lines. Zero the struct first.

--- a/src/gui_w32.c
+++ b/src/gui_w32.c
@@ -8489,7 +8489,7 @@
 update_toolbar_size(void)
 {
     int		w, h;
-    TBMETRICS	tbm;
+    TBMETRICS	tbm = {0};
 
     tbm.cbSize = sizeof(TBMETRICS);
     tbm.dwMask = TBMF_PAD | TBMF_BUTTONSPACING;
